# Gradewise AI — Cursor Project Rules

> **Canonical source:** `CLAUDE.md` at repo root. This file is a quick index for Cursor agents.

---

## Repository

| App | Path | Stack | Port |
|-----|------|-------|------|
| Backend | `grade-wise-ai-backend-fastify/` | Fastify 5 · TS 6 (strict) · Drizzle · PostgreSQL · Redis · BullMQ · AI SDK 6 · Vitest | 8000 |
| Frontend | `grade-wise-ai-frontend-next/` | Next.js 16 · React 19 · Tailwind 4 · Zustand 5 · TanStack Query · Zod 4 · Playwright | 3000 |
| CI/CD | `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` | SSH deploy → PM2 restart → health check | — |

**Deprecated:** `grade-wise-ai-backend-v2/` (Express) — do not use or reference.

---

## Commands

```bash
# Backend
cd grade-wise-ai-backend-fastify
npm run dev              # API on :8000
npm run dev:worker       # BullMQ worker (USE_ASYNC_JOBS=true)
npm run typecheck        # tsc --noEmit
npm run build            # tsc + fonts copy
npm test                 # Vitest
npm run db:push          # push schema (local)
npm run db:seed          # seed super_admin

# Frontend
cd grade-wise-ai-frontend-next
npm run dev              # Next.js on :3000
npm run build            # production build
npm run lint             # ESLint flat config
npm run test:e2e         # Playwright
```

### Quality Gates (before every commit)

```bash
# Backend
npm run typecheck && npm run build && npm test

# Frontend
npm run build && npm run lint
```

---

## Non-Negotiables

1. **TypeScript strict** — Backend has `strict: true` + `noUncheckedIndexedAccess: true`. Never use `any`.
2. **ESM with `.js` suffixes** — All backend imports use `.js` extension (NodeNext resolution).
3. **Cookie auth only** — JWT in httpOnly cookie (`gradewise_token`); never localStorage/sessionStorage.
4. **Services throw `AppError`** — Routes stay thin; business logic in services.
5. **AI keys encrypted** — AES-256-GCM via `encryptSecret`/`decryptSecret`. Never log or expose keys.
6. **Config cache** — `system_configs` cached 60s. Call `invalidateConfigCache()` after writes.
7. **Google OAuth** — Backend verifies Firebase ID tokens via custom `verifyGoogleIdToken()`.
8. **RBAC** — `authenticate` + `authorize(...roles)` preHandler hooks. Roles: super_admin > admin > instructor > student.

---

## Backend Architecture

### Module Pattern

```
src/modules/<domain>/
├── index.ts            # Route definitions (prefix: /api/<domain>)
├── <domain>.schema.ts  # Zod request/response schemas
└── <domain>.service.ts # Business logic (throws AppError)
```

### Key Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `src/app.ts` | Fastify app factory (plugins, hooks, routes) |
| `src/index.ts` | Server entry point |
| `src/worker.ts` | BullMQ worker entry point |
| `src/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle table definitions (11 tables) |
| `src/ai/providers.ts` | AI provider rotation + config from DB |
| `src/ai/generate.ts` | `generateContent()` / `generatePdfContent()` |
| `src/utils/crypto.ts` | AES-256-GCM encrypt/decrypt + Firebase token verify |
| `src/utils/pdf.ts` | PDFKit physical paper generator (RTL support) |
| `src/utils/errors.ts` | AppError hierarchy + `toHttpError()` mapper |
| `src/hooks/authenticate.ts` | JWT verification preHandler |
| `src/hooks/authorize.ts` | Role-based RBAC preHandler |

### 37 API Routes

- **Auth** (12): signup, login, Google OAuth, logout, me, verify, forgot/change password, user management
- **Assessments** (10): CRUD, enrollment, preview, physical paper PDF
- **Taking** (4): start, submit, status poll, submission detail
- **Config** (9): AI key CRUD, model set, test, bulk update
- **Resources** (4): upload (PDF/DOCX/txt), list, delete
- **Instructor Analytics** (4): overview, assessments, students, questions
- **Student Analytics** (7): overview, assessments, performance, detail, questions, report, recommendations

### AI Provider System

- **6 providers**: Gemini, Groq, OpenAI, Claude, Mistral, DeepSeek
- **Config keys**: `TEXT_<PROVIDER>_KEYS`, `TEXT_<PROVIDER>_MODEL`, `PDF_<PROVIDER>_KEYS`
- **Rotation**: `callWithRotation()` tries up to 4 providers with cooldown
- **Current Groq models**: `openai/gpt-oss-120b`, `openai/gpt-oss-20b`, `qwen/qwen3.6-27b`
- **Default fallbacks** in `src/ai/constants.ts`

### Database

- **Driver**: `postgres` (postgres.js), max 20 connections
- **ORM**: Drizzle ORM with typed queries
- **Enums**: role, auth_provider, question_type, attempt_status, resource_content_type, visibility
- **Seeding**: `npm run db:seed` creates super_admin + system_configs from env vars

---

## Frontend Architecture

### Feature Module Pattern

```
src/features/<domain>/
├── api.js     # API calls (uses shared apiClient)
└── store.js   # Zustand store (optional)
```

### Key Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `src/proxy.js` | Next.js 16 middleware — auth gate (cookie check) |
| `src/lib/apiClient.js` | Axios instance (`withCredentials: true`, base URL) |
| `src/lib/cn.js` | `clsx` + `tailwind-merge` utility |
| `src/lib/ui.js` | UI component catalog |
| `src/components/ui/` | Design system primitives (Button, Card, Input, Modal, etc.) |
| `src/components/ProtectedRoutes.jsx` | Client-side route guard |
| `src/components/Providers.jsx` | Context wrapper (TanStack Query, theme, etc.) |
| `src/schemas/fields.js` | Shared Zod field validators |

### Views Layer

- `app/` pages are thin wrappers that render `views/<Role>/` components
- Route groups: `(auth)`, `(dashboard)`, `(exam)`

### State Management

- **Server state**: TanStack Query (all data fetching/caching)
- **Client state**: Zustand (auth user, theme, assessment-taking state, UI state)
- **Forms**: react-hook-form + Zod resolver

### Tailwind v4

- No `tailwind.config.js` — CSS-first config in `globals.css`
- `@theme inline {}` block with custom tokens (edu-navy, edu-teal, edu-sky, edu-gold)
- Dark mode via `.dark` class on `<html>`
- `cn()` utility for class merging

---

## Common Pitfalls

1. **Port 8000**: Only ONE backend PM2 process should bind this port
2. **EADDRINUSE**: `pm2 delete <duplicate>` then `pm2 restart <name>`
3. **Config cache**: DB changes take 60s to reflect; restart PM2 for immediate effect
4. **SKIP_CAPTCHA**: Set `true` when no reCAPTCHA is configured
5. **FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID**: Must be set in backend `.env` for Google Auth to work
6. **Groq models**: Use current catalog (`openai/gpt-oss-120b`), not deprecated Llama models
7. **Font paths**: Backend builds copy fonts from `src/assets/fonts/` to `dist/assets/fonts/`
8. **Node version**: Server runs Node 22; use `npm install --ignore-engines` on deploy
